# Brandon Holdings Group

Three sibling repos. Treat them as one system.

| Piece | Path | Role |
|---|---|---|
| Public site | `/home/akani/Documents/Default Project` | Static clone at brandonholdingsgroup.com |
| Admin | `/home/akani/Documents/brandonholdingsgroup-admin` | Static panel at admin.brandonholdingsgroup.com |
| API | `/home/akani/Documents/brandonholdingsgroup-api` | Only component with secrets |

- Site and admin never talk to Firebase. They call `https://brandonholdingsgroup-api-delta.vercel.app`.
- Site `vercel.json` rewrites `/api/(.*)` to that API. HTML also hardcodes the origin.
- Admin default base is the same URL (`?api=` or `window.ADMIN_API_BASE` to override). Unlock with the API `ADMIN_TOKEN`.
- `SITE_ID` is `brandonholdings`. Local self-host: API `SITE_ROOT` = this site folder, port 8080.

## 12 serverless functions — hard cap

Never add a 13th `api/**/*.js` file in the API repo (Vercel Hobby limit; already at 12). New endpoints must reuse or merge an existing function file.

Current functions: `noop`, `contact`, `forminator`, `settings`, `stats`, `blog`, `admin/settings`, `admin/stats`, `admin/payments`, `ai`, `ikhokha/status`, `ikhokha/webhook`.

`/api/admin/blog` and `/api/chat` are rewrites onto `/api/blog` and `/api/ai` (rewrites do not count as functions). Do not add `api/voice.js` or `api/whatsapp/*.js` — keep extra AI channels on `api/ai.js`.
